lay","id":111130641,"node_id":"U_kgDOBp-4EQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111130641?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonFinlay","html_url":"https://github.com/DragonFinlay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonFinlay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonFinlay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonFinlay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonFinlay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonFinlay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonFinlay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonFinlay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonFinlay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonFinlay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-10-05T13:41:15Z","updated_at":"2022-10-05T13:41:15Z","body":"I'd hope so! The STEP import is still very new to PrusaSlicer and bugs are to be expected.\r\nThis issue will be kept open along others of the same kind until we can get to fixing them.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/issues/comments/1268457152/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/issues/comments/1268566562","html_url":"https://github.com/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/issues/8998#issuecomment-1268566562","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/issues/8998","id":1268566562,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAybtDc5LnMoi","user":{"login":"bubnikv","id":5830947,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MzA5NDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5830947?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/use